{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Rise and shine - it\u2019s the first day of your new job, and you're on probation period!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Armed with big dreams and a bigger bat, smash your way through the offices, collect as many toys as you can, and use the commission to upgrade your skills to become the best Pi\u00f1ata Popper the industry has ever seen.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3743760/extras/GIF_1.gif?t=1748448944\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Pick up toys, sell your haul, and upgrade your abilities through a  skill tree.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3743760/extras/GIF_2.gif?t=1748448944\" /></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">Demo Content</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">This demo features the <strong>first of 10 planned Prestige Areas</strong> included in the full game.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Approximately <strong>45 minutes to 1 hour</strong> of gameplay.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">The <strong>talent tree upgrades</strong> available in the demo represent just a small portion of the full progression system you'll experience in the full game.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Progress made in the demo <strong>will not carry over to the full game,</strong> as we anticipate some changes and balance adjustments.</p></li></ul><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">Gameplay</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Smash every pi\u00f1ata to unlock the next room</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Collect toys and loot</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Sell toys to upgrade stats, skills, and smashing style</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Automatic attacking</p></li></ul>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3743760?t=1748448944","background_raw":"https://s